# DPLL simulator driver configuration
#

config DPLLSIM
	tristate "Simulated DPLL device"
	depends on DPLL
	help
	  This driver provides a simulated DPLL device for testing
	  and development purposes. It creates a virtual DPLL device
	  with configurable pins that can be controlled through the
	  DPLL subsystem netlink interface.

	  Similar to netdevsim for network devices, dpllsim allows
	  testing DPLL-related code without requiring actual hardware.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called dpllsim.
